// How much a run varies from the authored dungeon (docs/variety.md). An assets/variety.ron
// replaces this file whole; F5 does not re-read it, so restart the game after editing it.
// This embedded default never flips the whole dungeon: it keeps the dungeon exactly as it was
// authored. A room only varies if its author marked it flippable in the room editor.
(
    flip_percent: 0.0,   // chance, in percent (0 to 100), that a run plays the whole dungeon mirrored
                         // left to right; the F4 window's "Flip next run" can force it either way
    room_flip_percent: 50.0, // chance, in percent (0 to 100), that a room marked flippable is played
                         // mirrored in a run, drawn for each such room apart from the others (the hub
                         // is never mirrored); F4's "Flip rooms next run" can force it either way
)
